", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ec264b7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci nezávaznou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "62ac966", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Zavolat 731 842 606", "link": {"url": "tel:+420731842606", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--ghost ww-btn--plain"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "f5883c2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span>✓ Weby od 9 900 Kč</span><span>✓ Nabídka zdarma</span><span>✓ Koncept agentury Yesmark</span></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-trust ww-rv"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "585db5c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<figure class=\"v-hv\"><img src=\"https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg\" alt=\"Kolik stojí web – ukázka webu Monika Veličková\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Reference · Monika Veličková</figcaption></figure>", "_css_classes": "ww-rv"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "6a71343", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white ww-tocsec", "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "10de383", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e06fbe3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><b>Na této stránce:</b><a href=\"#o-sluzbe\">Kolik stojí web u nás</a><a href=\"#prehled\">Co ovlivňuje cenu</a><a href=\"#detail\">Podrobnosti</a><a href=\"#reference\">Reference</a><a href=\"#cenik\">Cena a FAQ</a><a href=\"#poptavka\">Poptávka</a></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-toc"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "c2a0837", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "o-sluzbe"}, "elements": [{"id": "a7bb1db", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-local", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "70c1c22", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-local-copy ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4cf60db", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena a ceník", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7a7b730", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Kolik stojí web u nás", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4d55dc3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Jednodušší prezentační web u nás začíná na <strong>9 900 Kč</strong>. Za tu cenu dostanete moderní web pro mobil i počítač, kontaktní formulář, základní SEO a zaškolení do administrace.</p><p>Kolik stojí web s více stránkami, rezervacemi, jazykovými verzemi nebo e-shopem, spočítáme individuálně. Nabídku připravíme zdarma po krátkém hovoru – a vždy s jasným rozpisem, co v ceně je a co ne.</p><p>Neprodáváme balíčky, které nutí platit za funkce, které nepotřebujete. Cenu tvorby webových stránek skládáme podle skutečného rozsahu projektu.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "27a9a3a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-citycard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7711520", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "V ceně je vždy", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fa51d8e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType